{"nodes": [{"id": "src_chrono_thirdparty_yaml_cpp_test_googletest_1_13_0_cmakelists_googletest_distribution", "label": "googletest-distribution CMake project", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/chrono_thirdparty/yaml-cpp/test/googletest-1.13.0/CMakeLists.txt", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "CMake support is explicitly community-maintained - the note at the top says the maintainers do not use CMake internally, which is why Bazel is what CI exercises. CXX_EXTENSIONS is disabled everywhere except Cygwin, MSYS and QNX, where the toolchains need them."}, {"id": "src_chrono_thirdparty_yaml_cpp_test_googletest_1_13_0_cmakelists_build_gmock", "label": "BUILD_GMOCK option", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/chrono_thirdparty/yaml-cpp/test/googletest-1.13.0/CMakeLists.txt", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Defaults ON and adds only the googlemock subdirectory, because the googlemock target already builds googletest - adding both would double-define the targets."}, {"id": "src_chrono_thirdparty_yaml_cpp_test_googletest_1_13_0_cmakelists_install_gtest", "label": "INSTALL_GTEST option", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/chrono_thirdparty/yaml-cpp/test/googletest-1.13.0/CMakeLists.txt", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Exists so projects that embed googletest can turn installation off and avoid shipping a second copy of gtest headers and libs."}, {"id": "src_chrono_thirdparty_yaml_cpp_test_googletest_1_13_0_cmakelists_gtest_has_absl", "label": "GTEST_HAS_ABSL option", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "src/chrono_thirdparty/yaml-cpp/test/googletest-1.13.0/CMakeLists.txt", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Off by default becaus